---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  showHeader={false}
  showFooter={false}
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="fun-container">
    <div class="prose">
      <img src="/car.gif" alt="" class="car-gif" />
      <p>
        I need several piles of money for the operation, maintenance and creation of websites and, above all, for financing my meager queer life, thanks to which I can create such important and undoubtedly societally transformative content. Without my comments on pop cultural trends (and your payroll), Italy will degenerate into Orbán's Hungary within ten hours.
      </p>
      <p>
        Forget your loved ones and other members of your communities who have to face difficult life situations such as difficult financial situations or life-limiting illnesses. I need your money and attention more (after all, who would want to share spaces with people experiencing those difficulties, let alone community).
      </p>
      <p>
        I therefore appeal to your conscience and invite you to <a href="https://translifeline.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">donate accordingly</a>. If you don't pay immediately, the kitty (me) will die of grief and it will be all your fault.
      </p>
      <a href="/" class="back-link">&larr; Back to home</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .fun-container {
    margin: auto 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .car-gif {
    display: block;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    max-width: 300px;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
